# Исключение: этим скриптом собирается опубликованная страница tz.pikov.expert.
# Пока он был вне git, чистка брендинга его не увидела, и следующая пересборка
# вернула бы логотип бывшего учебного центра на живой сайт. В релиз каталог
# tools всё равно не попадает (см. Should-ExcludeDirectory в build-release.ps1).
!tz/tools/
!tz/tools/build-tz-landing.mjs
**/tests/
**/test-results/
**/М БРПО расписание*.md

# High-risk distributables pending explicit redistribution review.
# These never enter the repository, and this rule has no exceptions.
#
# The global release builder quarantines these formats without an exception.
# A future publication decision requires a reproducible, rights-reviewed
# builder plus an explicit release allowlist and regression gate.
**/*.pdf
**/*.pptx
**/*.docx
**/*.xlsx
**/*.eps

# Public first-day AppSec documents remain reproducible in the repository;
# generated ZIP bundles remain ignored above. The photographed slides are an
# internal editorial source, not a public site asset.
!appsec-lections/downloads/day-01/**/*.pdf
!appsec-lections/downloads/day-01/**/*.docx
/appsec-lections/downloads/day-01/slides/

# Day 2 follows the same publication rule: the working slide photographs are
# an editorial source only. The published deck is assets/day-02-reconstructed-slides.js.
/appsec-lections/assets/day-02-slides/
/appsec-lections/assets/day-02-slides.js
/appsec-lections/materials/день-2-слайды-фотоархив.md

# Third-party/course materials pending explicit redistribution review
**/materials_from_4days/
**/IMG_*.jpg
p19/materials/
astralinux01/materials/astra-linux-se-1.8.3.7/

# Teacher-only lecture materials: plans, methodology, answer keys and any
# third-party course documents. Never tracked - the repository is public and
# some source documents carry redistribution restrictions.
**/_teacher/

